# ── private family data — the repo is a template; the data lives behind auth ──
# The recipes, the photos and the kids starter are the family's content, not the
# app's. They were tracked and pushed while the repo was public; removing them here
# stops NEW commits carrying them, but the pushed history still contains every one
# until the repo goes private. Cache-removal is not retraction.
מתכונים.md
kids-starter.json
photos/*.jpg
photos/*.jpeg
photos/*.png
my_recipes_gemini.json
aviente/public/_upload/
